# ================================================
# Sub .gitignore - Khusus Folder .claude
# ================================================

# 1. Abaikan TOTAL semua file dan folder di dalam .claude/
*

# 2. PENGECUALIAN: Jangan abaikan file .gitignore ini sendiri
!.gitignore


# 3. PENGECUALIAN: Tetap izinkan folder memory dan file MEMORY.md
!memory/
!memory/MEMORY.md
!memory/**